diff --git a/public/fonts/jersey/README.txt b/public/fonts/jersey/README.txt
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..4d21f2e4e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/public/fonts/jersey/README.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Jersey number fonts for the NFL History mod's jersey cards (src/ui/components/JerseyNumber.tsx).
+
+Team replica fonts, fan-made, from the "NFL Fonts" designer on FontSpace (Freeware, Non-Commercial):
+  det.ttf  NFL Detroit Lions          https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-detroit-lions-font-f20183
+  jax.ttf  NFL Jacksonville Jaguars   https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-jacksonville-jaguars-font-f20180
+  lac.ttf  NFL San Diego Chargers     https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-san-diego-chargers-font-f20181
+  mia.ttf  NFL Miami Dolphins         https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-miami-dolphins-font-f20182
+  min.ttf  NFL Minnesota Vikings      https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-minnesota-vikings-font-f20179
+  sea.ttf  NFL Seattle Seahawks Flat  https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-seattle-seahawks-flat-font-f20177
+  tb.ttf   NFL Tampa Bay Buccaneers   https://www.fontspace.com/nfl-tampa-bay-buccaneers-font-f20468
+
+Look-alikes for every other team and era, from Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1), cut down to digits, capitals
+and . ' - :
+  saira.woff2   Saira Condensed Black   (classic block)
+  oswald.woff2  Oswald Bold             (Steelers-style condensed)
+  nunito.woff2  Nunito Black            (rounded: Rams, Chargers 2020-)
+  chakra.woff2  Chakra Petch Bold       (angular custom fonts)
+  squada.woff2  Squada One              (boxy custom fonts)
+  russo.woff2   Russo One               (rounded modern)
+  teko.woff2    Teko Bold               (modern condensed)
