+				<text x="20" y="33" textAnchor="middle" fontFamily="'Arial Black',Impact,sans-serif" fontWeight="900" fontSize="12.5" fontStyle="italic" fill="#d50a0a" stroke="#013369" strokeWidth="0.6" letterSpacing="-0.6">
+					NFL
