+// in the game's broadcast package (the same look as its score bug: a Sunday Night game looks like Sunday Night, a 1985
+// game like 1985):
+//   - the tale of the tape (records, scoring, the two quarterbacks)
+//   - each offense lined up against the other defense, on the field, with faces, numbers and ratings
+//   - the season leaders, head to head
+//   - the division standings (from week 5), the playoff picture and the MVP race (from week 9; never in the playoffs)
+// Also exports the data loader, which the broadcast reuses for player cards (a quarterback's first snap).
